# Migration assessment: `OVHcloud`, `Scaleway`, `UpCloud`

- Inventory file: `` `inventory.json` ``
- Source: `aws`
- Catalog: `OVHcloud` snapshot from `https://www.ovhcloud.com/en-ie/public-cloud/prices/`, retrieved 2026-11-27
- Catalog: `Scaleway` snapshot from `https://www.scaleway.com/en/pricing/`, retrieved 2026-11-27
- Catalog: `UpCloud` snapshot from `https://upcloud.com/pricing/`, retrieved 2026-11-27
- Region: `OVHcloud`: `GRA` (the target's default for estimates)
- Region: `Scaleway`: `fr-par` (the target's default for estimates)
- Region: `UpCloud`: `de-fra1` (the target's default for estimates)

## Comparison

### Summary

| Fit | `OVHcloud` | `Scaleway` | `UpCloud` |
|---|---|---|---|
| direct | 1 | 1 | 1 |
| partial | 0 | 0 | 0 |
| none | 0 | 0 | 0 |
| total | 1 | 1 | 1 |
| `OVHcloud` estimate | €41.69 per month for 1 of 1 resource |  |  |
| `Scaleway` estimate |  | €49.70 per month for 1 of 1 resource |  |
| `UpCloud` estimate |  |  | €31.39 per month for 1 of 1 resource |

Estimates are list prices on each catalog's retrieval date, excluding VAT and discounts; each target's own section gives its basis.

### Resources

| ID | Category | `OVHcloud` fit | `OVHcloud` best offering | `OVHcloud` monthly estimate | `Scaleway` fit | `Scaleway` best offering | `Scaleway` monthly estimate | `UpCloud` fit | `UpCloud` best offering | `UpCloud` monthly estimate |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| `i-0123456789abcdef0` | `compute.vm` | direct | `Instances` | €41.69 | direct | `Instances` | €49.70 | direct | `Cloud Servers` | €31.39 |

